<title>FRANCE: Renault reiterates break-even target.</title>
<headline>Renault reiterates break-even target.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renault chairman Louis Schweitzer reiterated on Thursday the carmaker's objective to break even this year.</p>
<p>The company had &quot;the objective to return to equilibrium from this year&quot;, he told a news conference.</p>
<p>He also said that the controversial planned closure of the Vilvoorde plant in Belgium was tough but necessary.</p>
</text>
